    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Global Properties presents this large five bedroom semi detached home, with three bathrooms and an attached garage. This property is situated in the much sought after development of Church View, just off station road. Ideally suitable for a family wanting to live in a great area. With multiple schools on it’s doorstep, it’s central location in Ballincollig town removing the need for a car, this property will be in high demand.\r\n\r\nBallincollig is a lively town in County Cork, Ireland, located just west of Cork City. It is known for its friendly community, beautiful parks, and historic Ballincollig Regional Park. The town has a mix of modern shops, schools, cafés, and sports facilities, making it a popular place to live. Church View estate is located within a two minute walk of the town centre."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\r\nA bright porch area leads to the timber front door which opens to the hallway and gives access to the kitchen and living room, timber flooring.\r\n\r\nKitchen - 4.78m x 3.89m\r\nThis fully fitted kitchen boasts a selection of storage units and also provides access to the back garden through the patio door. Tiled, window blinds, cornicing.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 5.72m x 3.62m\r\nCozy family room with solid fuel burning stove and decorative mantle piece. Built in Shelving and storage, timber flooring, cornicing.\r\n\r\nFamily Room - 3.82m x 3.74m\r\nBright living room with gas fireplace, timber flooring, window blinds and curtains, cornicing.\r\n\r\nUtility - 3.71m x 2.62m\r\nAmple storage space, plumbed for washer/dryer, tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 3.51m x 1.95m\r\nW.C, W.H.B, bath, shower and tiled throughout.\r\n\r\nGarage - 4.9m x 3.6m\r\nAmple storage space with large timber doors. Easily converted to extra bedroom, granny flat or living space.\r\n\r\nCarpeted stairs to the first floor\r\n\r\nPrimary Bedroom - 16.31m x 3.56m\r\nLarge double room, with an en-suite and walk in closet. Timber flooring, window blinds & curtains.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.56m x 2.57m\r\nDouble room, timber flooring, window blinds & curtains.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.75m x 2.57m\r\nDouble room, built in wardrobe, timber flooring, window blinds & curtains.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 3.75m x 3.63m\r\nDouble room, built in wardrobe, carpeted, window blinds & curtains.\r\n\r\nBedroom 5 - 2.51m x 2.33m\r\nBuilt in wardrobe, carpeted, window blinds & curtains.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.01m x 1.6m\r\nW.C, wash hand basin, shower. Tiled throughout.\r\n\r\nFront Garden\r\nConcrete driveway with off street parking for up to four cars.\r\n\r\nBack Garden\r\nLow maintenance concrete back garden with a large storage shed"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Spacious Home - 160 sq mt\r\nAttached Garage - 18 sq mt\r\nGas Fired Central Heating\r\nGreat Condition\r\nExcellent Location\r\nExtended Kitchen/ Dining area\r\nParking for 4 Cars\r\nWithin Close Proximity to Schools, Shops & 24 Hour Bus Service\r\nEasy Access to South Link"
      },
